OL,3,GNEWSAMan pleads not guilty to
OL,4,ABridlington murder charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded not guilty to murder
OL,7,Ffollowing the death of a man in an
OL,8,Falleged stabbing in Bridlington.
OL,10,FIbrahim Yesildeniz, 25, died in
OL,11,Fhospital following the incident on
OL,12,FFirst Avenue in August.
OL,14,FMehmet Gundez, 24, of Flamborough Road,
OL,15,FBridlington denied murder during an
OL,16,Fappearance at Hull Crown Court on
OL,17,FMonday.
OL,19,FHe was remanded in custody and will
OL,20,Fface a trial at the same court starting
OL,21,Fon 23 November.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
